WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:06.965
Two cars collide fighting
for the first lap position.

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:08.925
Here comes a leader.
He dives into the turn.

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:12.012
I'm Dale Earnhardt Jr.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.225
And I'm on a journey.

00:00:17.225 --> 00:00:21.479
A journey to find and explore
old abandoned race tracks.

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:27.193
A journey that retraces
the footsteps of my heroes.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.696
And immortalizes
their greatness...

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.281
Green flag is waving.

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:34.200
...at the very places in
which they excel.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.869
Down the beach full throttle,

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:39.247
accelerating, sliding,
shifting in split seconds.

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:43.251
A journey that seeks closure
for anyone forced to cope

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:46.171
with the grief of losing
their beloved speedway.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:51.843
I've learned everything about
life right here on this asphalt.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:57.849
A journey that when it
started, I had no idea

00:00:57.849 --> 00:01:00.894
one of those people
would be me.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:03.772
That's crazy.

